  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://www.owl-ontologies.com/onDBTuning.owl#Rule_MV_CreationByBenefits">
    <hasDescription>When HyGainACVM &gt; CreationCostVM (figure 17, line 8), creates the real MaterializedView (derives), the CreateMaterializedViewStatement and an Action with the justification for the DBA.</hasDescription>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.owl-ontologies.com/onDBTuning.owl#Rule"/>
    <generatesAction rdf:resource="http://www.owl-ontologies.com/onDBTuning.owl#Action_MaterializedViewBenefitsHeuristic"/>
    <hasName>MV_CreationByBenefits</hasName>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://www.owl-ontologies.com/onDBTuning.owl#Action_DropHypotheticalIndex">
    <hasDescription>drop hypothetical index %;</hasDescription>
    <isPerformedBy rdf:resource="http://www.owl-ontologies.com/onDBTuning.owl#Function_DropHypotheticalIndex"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.owl-ontologies.com/onDBTuning.owl#Action"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <hasJustification>As the index proved beneficial to the database (Benefit: % x Creation cost: %), it was removed as hypothetical and created as a real index in the database.</hasJustification>
  </rdf:Description>
